<title>UK: Laird Group half year pretax profit slips.</title>
<headline>Laird Group half year pretax profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		16.8		   vs 18.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.9		    vs 4.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     33.4		   vs 37.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   493		    vs 447</p>
<p> Operating profit	 36.1		   vs 38.9</p>
<p> Interest payable	 2.7		    vs 1.4</p>
<p> Tax charge		 9.7		    vs 12.0</p>
<p> Net taxed		  23.7		   vs 25.5</p>
<p> Retained profit	  16.8		   vs 18.9</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec 6</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov 5  Ex-div date		Oct 28</p>
<p>Note - Laird Group Plc, UK automotive and industrial parts group, said the year had started slowly against an exceptionally strong 1995. But it said good progress continued to be made in developing and extending Laird's international pressence in selected markets.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
